  data: {
    LLM: "Prioritize capturing the 10s of any suit; they are the fastest way to win the 'Game' point.\n\nThe Lead: If your partner has the High trump (Ace), lead a small trump to 'pull' the opponent's trumps and expose their Jack.\n\nHanging the Jack: High-level play revolves around detecting who holds the Jack. If you suspect an opponent has a 'lone' Jack, lead an Ace of trumps immediately to 'Hang' it for 3 points.",
    Player: "Prioritize capturing the 10s of any suit; they are the fastest way to win the 'Game' point.\n\nThe Lead: If your partner has the High trump (Ace), lead a small trump to 'pull' the opponent's trumps and expose their Jack.\n\nHanging the Jack: High-level play revolves around detecting who holds the Jack. If you suspect an opponent has a 'lone' Jack, lead an Ace of trumps immediately to 'Hang' it for 3 points.",
